  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>Portable, shoulder-fired Blaster Cannons fire powerful bolts of energy. Often used as an antivehicle weapon, the Blaster Cannon has the range and power to inflict devastation on troops and structures alike. </p><p>A Blaster Cannon is an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area Attack\">Area Attack</a>&nbsp;weapon. It deals full damage to the target if the attack hits its <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>&nbsp;(half damage if it has the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Evasion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Evasion\">Evasion</a></b>&nbsp;Talent) and half damage if it misses (no damage if it has the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Evasion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Evasion\">Evasion</a></b>&nbsp;Talent). Any creature or object in the 1-Square <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Splash\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Splash\">Splash</a> radius of the target takes half damage if the attack hits (no damage if it has the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Evasion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Evasion\">Evasion</a></b>&nbsp;Talent) and no damage if it misses. </p><p>A Blaster Cannon requires a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> to operate. After 10 shots, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> must be replaced. </p><p><b>Inaccurate:</b>&nbsp;This weapon cannot fire at targets at Long <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p><p><b>Special:</b> This is an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area Attack\">Area Attack</a> Weapon. </p>",
